<title>GERMANY: Buderus H1 96/97 profit up to 83 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>Buderus H1 96/97 profit up to 83 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>WETZLAR, Germany 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     83	vs 67</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,587   vs 1,489</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>     Domestic				    1,126   vs 1,077</p>
<p>     Foreign				     461     vs 412</p>
<p>    Investments				  42	vs 71</p>
<p>    Write-offs				   61	vs 63</p>
<p>    Employees (at 31.3)			9,723   vs 10,441</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German heating and appliance group is Buderus AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
